 "attestation": "Boundaries from Seshat Cliopatria (Bennett et al., Scientific Data 2025; CC BY 4.0), digitized from standard historical atlases at ~0.07° resolution. The core coastal city-states are well attested in Assyrian annals, Hebrew scriptures, and Greek sources, but mapping Phoenicia as a territorial unit is inherently problematic because it was never a unified polity; extent polygons are necessarily schematic. Capsule researched for this polity/era specifically (confidence: high).",
